bc.co.uk/news/articles/c3qjnwye0ep5o?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">AI uncovered long-hidden programming flaws, triggering a rare global cyber-security response.</summary></entry><entry><title>'It's been relentless' say IT workers on frontline of PHP cyber-security scramble</title><id>https://www.bbc.co.uk/news/articles/cxnv025d8qpmo#0</id><updated>2026-10-27T05:18:11Z</updated><published>2026-10-23T12:00:25Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.co.uk/news/articles/cxnv025d8qpmo--6bedddec950a.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.co.uk/news/articles/cxnv025d8qpmo?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">IT and cyber experts have told the BBC about their struggles in the last 48 hours to update their systems.</summary></entry><entry><title>The Indian workers filming their work to train AI</title><id>https://www.bbc.co.uk/news/articles/ckvgyml6pdm9o#0</id><updated>2026-10-27T05:18:11Z</updated><published>2026-10-23T08:04:17Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.co.uk/news/articles/ckvgyml6pdm9o--8cd3bc33d6ac.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.co.uk/news/articles/ckvgyml6pdm9o?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">Indian workers are being paid to film themselves at work and the footage is used to train AI.</summary></entry><entry><title>Zuckerberg wins Meta deal to help him foot bill for possible California billionaire tax</title><id>https://www.bbc.co.uk/news/articles/cky83vwnyglno#0</id><updated>2026-10-27T05:18:11Z</updated><published>2026-10-22T18:26:56Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.co.uk/news/articles/cky83vwnyglno--c1ff1ed6121e.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.co.uk/news/articles/cky83vwnyglno?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">The Meta boss had said he would exit the state over a wealth tax that has not yet come into force.</summary></entry><entry><title>Race to update services' computer systems after cyber-security flaw found</title><id>https://www.bbc.co.uk/news/articles/c9j34zgmkxx1o#0</id><updated>2026-10-27T05:18:11Z</updated><published>2026-10-22T17:12:51Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.co.uk/news/articles/c9j34zgmkxx1o--3c6c6b81f250.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.co.uk/news/articles/c9j34zgmkxx1o?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">Websites were taken offline after the developers of programming language PHP said "critical vulnerabilities" had been discovered.</summary></entry><entry><title>Zoe Kleinman: PHP is the cyber equivalent of an unexploded bomb</title><id>https://www.bbc.co.uk/news/articles/cw98z6qlyvg3o#0</id><updated>2026-10-27T05:18:11Z</updated><published>2026-10-22T10:17:26Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.co.uk/news/articles/cw98z6qlyvg3o--08e8546be458.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.co.uk/news/articles/cw98z6qlyvg3o?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">It has been a dramatic, public and global response, but the cyber event hasn't happened yet.</summary></entry><entry><title>'500 new vulnerabilities' found in government, says AI minister</title><id>https://www.bbc.co.uk/news/videos/c6y8lvg2p50po#0</id><updated>2026-10-27T05:18:11Z</updated><published>2026-10-22T10:08:44Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.co.uk/news/videos/c6y8lvg2p50po--618affb72c51.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.co.uk/news/videos/c6y8lvg2p50po?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">'500 new vulnerabilities' found in government, says AI minister</summary></entry><entry><title>Tech Life</title><id>https://www.bbc.co.uk/sounds/play/w3ct8jyl#2</id><updated>2026-10-27T05:18:11Z</updated><published>2026-10-20T19:45:00Z</published><li